// MUST FAIL: `while`. DESIGN.md:152 — control flow is `.match` only; iteration is
// `loop`, "a genuinely ordinary function" (DESIGN.md:158) taking a closure
// (DESIGN.md:717-743). `while cond { .. }` is two juxtaposed expressions.

count* = (n :: i32) () {
    while n < 10 {
        n = n + 1;
    }
}
